Oh, thank you very much!

1822
01:09:56,033 --> 01:09:57,620
You know, we're all traveling.

1823
01:09:57,620 --> 01:10:01,037
You, me, that little gold guy over there.

1824
01:10:02,069 --> 01:10:04,399
We're traveling on the
big trip of life, and,

1825
01:10:04,399 --> 01:10:06,227
sometimes it turns out,

1826
