Is...

1869
01:11:39,530 --> 01:11:40,363
Me!

1870
01:11:41,200 --> 01:11:43,197
Oh, thank you very much!

1871
01:11:43,197 --> 01:11:44,826
(applause)
Oh, thank you very much!

1872
01:11:44,826 --> 01:11:46,939
Oh, thank you, thank you very much!

1873
01:11:46,939 --> 01:11:47,955
- We've got commercial sign,

1874
01:11:47,955 --> 01:11:50,565
I'll be right back on down to meet you.

1875
01:11:50,565 --> 01:11:51,846
- I'll be here all week, thank you!

1876
