- A herring!

2008
01:18:04,799 --> 01:18:06,265
- In place of a spear,

2009
01:18:06,265 --> 01:18:07,406
- Oh.

2010
01:18:07,406 --> 01:18:08,239
- Or a blade,

2011
01:18:08,239 --> 01:18:09,766
- You're making this up, aren't you?

2012
01:18:09,766 --> 01:18:12,449
- A sweetly sounding...

2013
01:18:12,449 --> 01:18:13,384
- It's!

2014
01:18:13,384 --> 01:18:14,217
- Kantele.

2015
01:18:15,660 --> 01:18:16,711
