- And we have them, here in
these ancient pine trees.

2022
01:18:28,606 --> 01:18:32,416
We'll cut them down,
make the harps ourselves.

2023
01:18:32,416 --> 01:18:35,916
- Great, we spend the winter making harps.

2024
01:18:36,891 --> 01:18:37,746
- What are you looking at?

2025
01:18:37,746 --> 01:18:39,568
- Come, boys,

2026
01:18:39,568 --> 01:18:43,028
take all the boats down to
the shores of the frozen sea.

2027
01:18:43,028 --> 01:18:43,945
- Whatever.

2028
01:18:45,226 --> 01:18:46,812
- And you, women.

2029
01:18:46,812 --> 01:18:48,315
- Back me up on this one.

2030
01:18:48,315 --> 01:18:51,364
