crucible of Ilmarinen.

2034
01:18:58,111 --> 01:19:02,278
He must have clear-sounding
strings for our kanteles.

2035
01:19:03,257 --> 01:19:05,417
- Yeah, first he has us making boats,

2036
01:19:05,417 --> 01:19:06,679
then we gotta do the horse,

2037
01:19:06,679 --> 01:19:09,405
now it's the kanteles, oh!

2038
01:19:09,405 --> 01:19:11,391
