2080
01:21:09,903 --> 01:21:10,960
- Harps!

2081
01:21:10,960 --> 01:21:12,219
- Harps!

2082
01:21:12,219 --> 01:21:13,971
- I wonder, do they think they're

2083
01:21:13,971 --> 01:21:16,004
