2084
01:21:16,004 --> 01:21:18,401
- Ha, good one, your Hideousness!

2085
01:21:18,401 --> 01:21:20,151
- Liked it, liked it.

2086
01:21:21,835 --> 01:21:23,096
- Let's see.

2087
01:21:23,096 --> 01:21:25,596
Love, soft as an easy chair...

2088
01:21:28,262 --> 01:21:30,585
