2104
01:22:08,703 --> 01:22:11,266
That terrible music'll kill us all!

2105
01:22:11,266 --> 01:22:13,142
- Yeah, well, we put up with your Kenny G,

2106
01:22:13,142 --> 01:22:13,975
you cow.

2107
01:22:15,257 --> 01:22:19,211
