2197
01:26:05,326 --> 01:26:06,159
What do you want?

2198
01:26:06,159 --> 01:26:08,350
Keep awaaaay, keep awaaay!

2199
01:26:08,350 --> 01:26:10,957
Ohhh, the pain, the pain!

