just wait a minute, you know?

2204
01:26:27,473 --> 01:26:29,953
- Swede blanket Bingo.

2205
01:26:29,953 --> 01:26:31,953
- I'll take Sweden, wow!

2206
01:26:33,490 --> 01:26:35,445
- So they headed for
central Minnesota, you know,

2207
01:26:35,445 --> 01:26:37,438
to build Crystal, and Blaine and Fridley.

2208
01:26:37,438 --> 01:26:39,912
And they made bars, and
sought out church basements

2209
01:26:39,912 --> 01:26:40,829
