(robots crooning)

2307
01:29:56,639 --> 01:29:59,524
"Currently my husband
and I reside in Germany.

2308
01:29:59,524 --> 01:30:01,276
- Ah, Germany!

2309
01:30:01,276 --> 01:30:05,912
- "My husband is an army
bomb disposal expert.

2310
01:30:05,912 --> 01:30:09,770
"I am enclosing a photo of
their bomb disposal robot,

2311
01:30:09,770 --> 01:30:11,235
"and I want to let you know

2312
01:30:11,235 --> 01:30:13,027
"that he has been nicknamed Crow,

2313
01:30:13,027 --> 01:30:13,860
- [Robots] Huh?

2314
01:30:13,860 --> 01:30:15,059
- "in honor of Crow T. Robot."

2315
01:30:15,059 --> 01:30:16,892
- [Crow] Hey! Lemme see that.

2316
01:30:16,892 --> 01:30:17,725
- Wow, that's pretty neat.

2317
01:30:17,725 --> 01:30:18,558
No, I can't.

2318
01:30:18,558 --> 01:30:19,540
I think I should show this to Gypsy,

2319
01:30:19,540 --> 01:30:20,718
she's probably really like it.

2320
01:30:20,718 --> 01:30:21,735
- [Crow] Hey, hey, help us down!

2321
01:30:21,735 --> 01:30:23,325
I'd like to see that! Joel, Joel!

2322
01:30:23,325 --> 01:30:24,158
- [Tom] Can you give us a hand,

2323
01:30:24,158 --> 01:30:25,439
we'd really like to come down now!

2324
01:30:25,439 --> 01:30:26,860
- [Crow] Oh...

2325
01:30:26,860 --> 01:30:27,996
- [Tom] Joel, I, heh!

2326
01:30:27,996 --> 01:30:28,890
You might want to help us down,

2327
01:30:28,890 --> 01:30:30,190
cause we smell really good now.

2328
01:30:30,190 --> 01:30:32,469
I'm a T.J. cinnamon bun, mmmm!

2329
01:30:32,469 --> 01:30:34,175
- [Joel] Oh, I'm not, I'm not interested.

2330
01:30:34,175 --> 01:30:36,086
- [Crow] And I'm fresh applesauce!

2331
01:30:36,086 --> 01:30:37,253
Oh, he's gone.

2332
01:30:38,361 --> 01:30:39,460
- [Tom] Think he'll be back?

2333
01:30:39,460 --> 01:30:40,518
- [Crow] I don't know.

2334
01:30:40,518 --> 01:30:42,104
Hey, what's your bag smell like?

2335
01:30:42,104 --> 01:30:43,488
- [Tom] Oh, you don't wanna know.

2336
01:30:43,488 --> 01:30:45,315
(both shuddering)

2337
01:30:45,315 --> 01:30:46,783
- Frank, are you alright up there?

2338
01:30:46,783 --> 01:30:47,924
- [Frank] What do you care?

2339
01:30:47,924 --> 01:30:49,347
- Frank, I care a lot!

2340
01:30:49,347 --> 01:30:50,730
- [Frank] Then give me back my money!

2341
01:30:50,730 --> 01:30:52,645
- All you care about is money.

2342
01:30:52,645 --> 01:30:54,029
Well, maybe you need some time alone

2343
01:30:54,029 --> 01:30:55,615
to think about your priorities!

2344
01:30:55,615 --> 01:30:57,032
- [Frank] Woaaah!

2345
01:30:58,909 --> 01:30:59,742
- Oh!

2346
01:30:59,742 --> 01:31:02,242
(camera blips)

2347
01:31:02,242 --> 01:31:05,492
(dramatic synth music)

2348
01:32:04,636 --> 01:32:06,020
(trolls groaning)

2349
01:32:06,020 --> 01:32:08,937
- What's going to become of us now?

